1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,520
Pemimpin yang jaga Makkah ketika itu

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,550
ialah Tok Nabi, Abdul Muttalib.

3
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:08,260
Abdul Muttalib ni, sampai di

4
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:10,640
sempadan, Abrahah ambil unta-unta

5
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:11,380
Abdul Muttalib.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,500
Dia sembelih, dia bunuh unta-unta

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:15,170
Abdul Muttalib.

8
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:17,340
Abdul Muttalib pergi tuntut.

9
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:20,360
Wahai Abrahah, bawa balik unta aku.

10
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:22,949
Aku nak balik unta, kamu dah

11
00:00:22,949 --> 00:00:25,410
tangkap, dah sembelih, dah makan.

12
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:27,640
Unta itu unta aku.

13
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:29,413
Abrahah hairan.

14
00:00:29,413 --> 00:00:33,090
Hai, kamu ni, kamu hairankan unta

15
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:33,890
kamu ni.

16
00:00:33,890 --> 00:00:35,740
Kamu tak tahu ke aku ni

17
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,940
nak merobohkan Kaabah?

18
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:42,780
Yang kamu sayangkan unta kamu.

19
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:45,140
Kaabah kamu tak hairan ke?

20
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
Apa kata Abdul Muttalib?

21
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:50,390
Kaabah kamu tak sayang ke?

22
00:00:50,390 --> 00:00:53,880
Kata Abdul Muttalib, sesungguhnya

23
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,895
bagi Kaabah itu, adanya Rabbun

24
00:00:55,895 --> 00:00:59,400
yahmih, adanya Tuhan yang memelihara dia.

25
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:02,240
Abdul Muttalib tahu dah, turun-temurun

26
00:01:02,956 --> 00:01:06,660
Kaabah ni, Makkah ni, Allah pelihara.
